# 01_sleep_onset.ledc — Sleep Descent (~25 min, then silent + dark, no loop)
# Technique: playbook §C arc A "Sleep Descent". Alpha entry (10 Hz), short hold,
#            then a continuous slope-limited glide 10->2 Hz at ~0.44 Hz/min, then a
#            simultaneous Soft Off of light + audio at ~2 Hz. NO wake-up.
# Goal: fall asleep. Mirrors sleep architecture: alpha -> theta -> delta.
# Bands: alpha 10 Hz (hold 2 min) -> glide 10->2 Hz (18 min, ~0.44 Hz/min) -> delta ~2 Hz soft-off.
#
# SAFETY / CONTRAINDICATIONS:
#   Do NOT use if you have photosensitive epilepsy, a seizure disorder, or a history of
#   photic migraine. Do not use while driving or operating machinery. This is an
#   experiential relaxation aid, not a medical device.
#   Flicker stays <=10 Hz the whole session (never enters the 15-25 Hz photosensitive
#   danger band); warm amber only (no saturated-red strobe, no blue alternation);
#   brightness capped <=30%; LED brightness ramps IN over 10 s and fades to 0 (never an
#   abrupt cut); the delta core sits in the SAFER <3 Hz zone.
#
# Format: LED line = time freq duty bright R G B mask
#         Audio   = A time freq pan volume mod channel freq_r wave_type
# Binaural beat is encoded by holding a FIXED freq_r=250 and ramping the LEFT carrier
# `frequency` (freq_r is NOT interpolatable). Perceived beat = 250 - frequency:
#   carrier 240->beat 10 | 248->beat 2.
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start: the >/* prefix sits on the EARLIER entry, its
# value is the START, target = the next same-channel entry's value.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=0  Induction (~10 Hz alpha). Warm amber. Brightness ramp-IN 0->band over 10 s
#      (safety). Binaural beat 10 Hz (carrier 240 / R250). Volume fade-in.
0       >10 50 >0             255 100 0 10    # LED all-ch: 10 Hz flicker, bright 0-> (10 s ramp-in), amber
A 0     240 0 >0 0 1 250 0                     # ch1 binaural: carrier 240 / R250 = 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
A 0     0 0 >0 0 3 0 5                          # ch3 pink-noise bed (wave 5); vol fade-in
S 3000 default 52 "Beginning at ten hertz, in alpha. Let your breath slow and your body grow heavy."

# t=0:10  Brightness reached the breathing band -> breathing LFO (sine 25<->30% over
#         10 s ~ 6 breaths/min). Induction only.
10000   10 50 ~25:30:10000   255 100 0 10     # hold 10 Hz, breathing brightness LFO 25<->30%

# t=0:30  Pink-noise fade-in complete.
A 30000 0 0 16 0 3 0 5                          # ch3 pink-noise bed steady at 16

# t=0:45  Volume fade-in complete (ch1 -> 55).
A 45000 240 0 55 0 1 250 0                      # ch1 vol 55, beat holds 10 Hz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=2:00  Deepening: glide 10->2 Hz over 18 min (~0.44 Hz/min). Breathing LFO ends;
#         plain brightness descent 25->8; color glides amber -> deep red.
120000  >10 50 >25          >255 >100 >0 10   # LED freq 10->2; bright 25->8; color 255,100,0 -> 180,30,0
A 120000 >240 0 55 0 1 250 0                    # carrier 240->248 => beat 10->2 over 18 min
S 120000 default 52 "Drifting down now. Sinking through theta toward deep, slow delta."

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=20:00  Beat 2 Hz reached -> Soft Off begins. Brightness 8->0; quadratic volume
#          fade 55->0; pink-noise quad fade 16->0. No wake-up.
1200000 >2 50 >8           >180 >30 >0 10     # LED 2 Hz; bright 8->0; color 180,30,0 -> 150,20,0
A 1200000 248 0 *55 0 1 250 0                  # beat 2 Hz held; quad vol fade 55->0
A 1200000 0 0 *16 0 3 0 5                      # pink-noise quad fade 16->0
S 1200000 default 52 "Falling into deep delta, two hertz. The sound and light are fading. Sleep now."

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=25:00  Soft Off complete: brightness 0 AND volume 0 together -> silent + dark. No loop.
1500000 2 50 0             150 20 0 10        # 2 Hz, bright 0, dim deep-red (off)
A 1500000 248 0 0 0 1 250 0                    # ch1 beat 2 Hz, vol 0
A 1500000 0 0 0 0 3 0 5                        # ch3 pink-noise vol 0
S 1500000 default 52 "Two hertz, deep sleep. Rest."
